    "source": "Wang · Ch. 7 · Example 62",
    "note": "Course reading example with fixed practice inputs. ",
    "code": "def convert_mm2_to_m2(area_mm2):\n    \"\"\"Return area in m^2 from area in mm^2.\"\"\"\n    return area_mm2 / 1e6\n\n\ndef calculate_stress(force, area):\n    \"\"\"Return normal stress in Pa from force in N and area in m^2.\"\"\"\n    return force / area\n\n\ndef calculate_factor_of_safety(strength, stress):\n    \"\"\"Return factor of safety from material strength and stress.\"\"\"\n    return strength / stress\n\n\ndef classify_design(factor_of_safety, required_fos=2.0):\n    \"\"\"Return design status based on required factor of safety.\"\"\"\n    if factor_of_safety >= required_fos:\n        return \"ACCEPTABLE\"\n    else:\n        return \"NOT ACCEPTABLE\"\n\n\ndef print_design_report(force, area_mm2, strength, required_fos):\n    \"\"\"Print a design report for an axially loaded bar.\"\"\"\n    area_m2 = convert_mm2_to_m2(area_mm2)\n    stress = calculate_stress(force, area_m2)\n    fos = calculate_factor_of_safety(strength, stress)\n    status = classify_design(fos, required_fos)\n\n    print(\"BAR DESIGN REPORT\")\n    print(\"-----------------\")\n    print(f\"Force:              {force:.2f} N\")\n    print(f\"Area:               {area_mm2:.2f} mm^2\")\n    print(f\"Stress:             {stress / 1e6:.2f} MPa\")\n    print(f\"Material strength:  {strength / 1e6:.2f} MPa\")\n    print(f\"Factor of safety:   {fos:.2f}\")\n    print(f\"Required FoS:       {required_fos:.2f}\")\n    print(f\"Design status:      {status}\")\n\n\nprint_design_report(\n    force=10000,\n    area_mm2=500,\n    strength=250e6,\n    required_fos=2.0\n)",
    "output": "BAR DESIGN REPORT\n-----------------\nForce:              10000.00 N\nArea:               500.00 mm^2\nStress:             20.00 MPa\nMaterial strength:  250.00 MPa\nFactor of safety:   12.50\nRequired FoS:       2.00\nDesign status:      ACCEPTABLE",
