    "topic": "testing",
    "name": "Step 5: produce a clear engineering report",
    "source": "Wang · Ch. 8 · Example 50",
    "note": "Course reading example with fixed practice inputs. ",
    "code": "def mm2_to_m2(area_mm2):\n    \"\"\"Convert area from square millimeters to square meters.\"\"\"\n    if area_mm2 <= 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"Area must be positive.\")\n    return area_mm2 / 1_000_000\n\n\ndef mpa_to_pa(stress_mpa):\n    \"\"\"Convert stress or strength from MPa to Pa.\"\"\"\n    if stress_mpa <= 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"Strength must be positive.\")\n    return stress_mpa * 1_000_000\n\n\ndef calculate_stress(force, area):\n    \"\"\"Return axial stress in Pa for force in N and area in m^2.\"\"\"\n    if area <= 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"Area must be positive.\")\n    return force / area\n\n\ndef calculate_factor_of_safety(strength, stress):\n    \"\"\"Return factor of safety for positive strength and stress.\"\"\"\n    if strength <= 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"Strength must be positive.\")\n    if stress <= 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"Stress must be positive.\")\n    return strength / stress\n\n\ndef classify_design(factor_of_safety, required_fos=2.0):\n    \"\"\"Return design classification based on required factor of safety.\"\"\"\n    if factor_of_safety >= required_fos:\n        return \"acceptable\"\n    else:\n        return \"not acceptable\"\n\n\n\ndef run_tests():\n    assert mm2_to_m2(1_000_000) == 1.0\n    assert mpa_to_pa(1) == 1_000_000\n    assert calculate_stress(10, 2) == 5\n    assert calculate_factor_of_safety(250, 125) == 2\n    assert classify_design(2.0) == \"acceptable\"\n    assert classify_design(1.5) == \"not acceptable\"\n\n\ndef main():\n    force = 10000                  # N\n    area_mm2 = 500                 # mm^2\n    yield_strength_mpa = 250       # MPa\n    required_fos = 2.0\n\n    area_m2 = mm2_to_m2(area_mm2)\n    yield_strength_pa = mpa_to_pa(yield_strength_mpa)\n    stress_pa = calculate_stress(force, area_m2)\n    stress_mpa = stress_pa / 1_000_000\n    factor_of_safety = calculate_factor_of_safety(\n        yield_strength_pa, stress_pa\n    )\n    status = classify_design(factor_of_safety, required_fos)\n\n    print(\"BAR DESIGN CHECK\")\n    print(\"----------------\")\n    print(f\"Force: {force:.2f} N\")\n    print(f\"Area: {area_mm2:.2f} mm^2\")\n    print(f\"Yield strength: {yield_strength_mpa:.2f} MPa\")\n    print(f\"Stress: {stress_mpa:.2f} MPa\")\n    print(f\"Factor of safety: {factor_of_safety:.2f}\")\n    print(f\"Required factor of safety: {required_fos:.2f}\")\n    print(f\"Design status: {status}\")\n\n\nrun_tests()\nmain()",
    "output": "BAR DESIGN CHECK\n----------------\nForce: 10000.00 N\nArea: 500.00 mm^2\nYield strength: 250.00 MPa\nStress: 20.00 MPa\nFactor of safety: 12.50\nRequired factor of safety: 2.00\nDesign status: acceptable",
