    "code": "def binary_search(sorted_values, target):\n    \"\"\"Return the index of target in sorted_values.\n\n    Return None if target is not found.\n    The input list must be sorted in increasing order.\n    \"\"\"\n    low = 0\n    high = len(sorted_values) - 1\n\n    while low <= high:\n        mid = (low + high) // 2\n        mid_value = sorted_values[mid]\n\n        if mid_value == target:\n            return mid\n        elif mid_value < target:\n            low = mid + 1\n        else:\n            high = mid - 1\n\n    return None\n\n\nvalues = [0.0, 0.5, 1.0, 1.5, 2.0, 2.5, 3.0]\nindex = binary_search(values, 2.5)\nprint(index)",
